# MOBILE_TARGET_URL controls which web origin the WebView loads.
# - For local dev, expose `npm run dev` in /frontend through a tunnel
#   (cloudflared / ngrok) and paste that HTTPS URL here. The simulator
#   cannot reach `http://localhost:3002` directly on iOS, and only via
#   `http://10.0.2.2:3002` on Android (which also requires cleartext = true,
#   which we keep off by default for security).
# - For production builds, leave this unset and capacitor.config.ts will
#   default to https://monitor-parlamentari.cat.
MOBILE_TARGET_URL=
